<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 69.8013 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 69.8013 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 69.8013 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.7125 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 2		   Oct 1</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.8013		 69.7125</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  4.775		   7.300</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 46.00		   45.8955</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.005		   0.050</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
